{"id":403907002,"chapter_id":21000106,"scene_id":604,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"你们在船上的餐厅安顿下来。","style":3,"background":1054,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"相对充足的食物储备、可供取暖的燃炉，以及最重要的，还未被严重破坏的门窗和墙壁。","style":3,"background":1054,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"相比漫水的下层舱室，这已经是派尔琪雅能找到的最好的、能够长期生活的区域了。","style":3,"background":1054,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"派尔琪雅","content":"今天的晚餐是油浸金枪鱼罐头。","voice":["vo_event_403907002_04"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_39072","style":1,"background":1054,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"派尔琪雅将加热过的罐头用火钳递到你跟前。","style":3,"background":1054,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"派尔琪雅","content":"小心烫。","voice":["vo_event_403907002_06"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_39072","style":1,"background":1054,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"你没有半点胃口，却无法拒绝派尔琪雅的好意，也知晓进食的必要性。","style":3,"background":1054,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"于是你缓慢地、机械地重复着将鱼肉送进嘴中的动作。","style":3,"background":1054,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"派尔琪雅","content":"……","voice":["vo_event_403907002_09"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_39072","style":1,"background":1054,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"派尔琪雅","content":"有一天，一只螃蟹出门散步的时候不小心撞到了金枪鱼。金枪鱼很生气地问：“你是不是瞎啊？”","voice":["vo_event_403907002_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_39072","style":1,"background":1054,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"派尔琪雅","content":"螃蟹很委屈，它说：“不是啊，我是螃蟹。”","voice":["vo_event_403907002_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_39072","style":1,"background":1054,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……？","style":2,"background":1054,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"你的神经早已麻木迟钝，过去好久才意识到，派尔琪雅给你讲了个笑话。","style":3,"background":1054,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"笑话很冷，派尔琪雅也没什么喜剧天赋，可你还是笑了。","style":3,"background":1054,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"很有趣，派尔琪雅……谢谢你。","style":2,"background":1054,"log_type":1}]}